# Local model for the crew: qwen3:4b-instruct (Qwen3-4B-Instruct-2507).
# It supports tool calling and does not "think" before answering, which keeps each agent
# step fast on CPU-only machines. num_ctx: Ollama's default of 4096 tokens is too small for
# CrewAI's agent prompts (the largest prompt + answer is about 5K), while 16384 used enough
# RAM on an 8 GB-free laptop for Ollama to run out of memory mid-answer.
#   ollama create interview-prep-qwen3 -f ollama/Modelfile
FROM qwen3:4b-instruct
PARAMETER num_ctx 8192
PARAMETER temperature 0.7
PARAMETER top_p 0.8
PARAMETER top_k 20
